      "id": "matins",
      "title": "Matins",
      "sourceHeading": "Ad Matutinum",
      "pages": [
        527
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Benedicti sint sancti Joachim et Anna, ex quibus benedicta Virgo Maria sine originali labe concepta et nata est.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0001",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine, labia mea aperies.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0002",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et os meum annuntiabit laudem tuam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0003",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Deus, in adjutorium meum intende.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Domine, ad adjuvandum me festina.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Gloria Patri. Alleluia.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "A Septuagesima usque ad Pascha, loco Alleluia, dicitur: Laus tibi, Domine, Rex aeternae gloriae.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Hymnus",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O bina conjugalis Exempla foederis! O Joachim, qualis Mariae conjugis! O Anna, quem nepotem, Quam nacta filiam! O Joachim, dotem Quis optet alteram!",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Sap. 4. 1. O quam pulchra est casta generatio cum claritate! immortalis est enim memoria illius, quoniam et apud Deum nota est, et apud homines.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Orate pro nobis, sancti Joachim et Anna.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0011",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Ut digni efficiamur promissionibus Christi.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0012",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0013",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Deus, qui prae omnibus Sanctis tuis beatos Joachim et Annam genitrices Filii tui parentes esse voluisti: concede, quaesumus; ut quos devoto cultu veneramur in terris, eorum quoque patrocinia sentiamus in caelis. Per eundem Dominum nostrum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0014",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine, exaudi orationem meam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0015",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et clamor meus ad te veniat.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0016",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Benedicamus Domino.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0017",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Deo gratias.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0018",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Fidelium animae per misericordiam Dei requiescant in pace.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            527
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0019",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
